cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Surplus AI: check before you buy"
abstract: >-
  Surplus AI is a student prototype of a closed-network construction surplus
  platform for township developers. It forecasts leftover material from
  ordered versus planned quantities, recommends how much to reserve from other
  sites before ordering new, explains every recommendation with its evidence,
  and keeps people in control of every decision. Built for the Sime Darby
  Property University Hackathon 2026 using simulated data.
authors:
